{"id":"tranquillement","lemma":"tranquillement","pos":"adv","rank":3381,"glosses":["calmly, peacefully, quietly, serenely, tranquilly"],"ipa":"/tʁɑ̃.kil.mɑ̃/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/2/28/Fr-tranquillement.ogg/Fr-tranquillement.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Il marchait tranquillement.","en":"He walked quietly.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/12599","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"to walk","l":"marcher"},null]},{"text":"Les enfants jouaient tranquillement ensemble.","en":"The children played quietly together.","words":[{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},{"g":"child","l":"enfant"},{"g":"to play","l":"jouer"},null,{"g":"together"}]},{"text":"Elle rentra tranquillement dans la pièce.","en":"She quietly entered the room.","words":[{"g":"she / it"},{"g":"to go back","l":"rentrer"},null,{"g":"in"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"room in a house, etc."}]},{"text":"Les deux sœurs vivaient très tranquillement.","en":"The two sisters lived very peacefully.","words":[{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},{"g":"two"},{"g":"sister (a daughter of…","l":"sœur"},{"g":"to live","l":"vivre"},{"g":"very"},null]},{"text":"Tom s'est assis tranquillement.","en":"Tom sat quietly.","words":[null,{"g":"oneself / if"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"sat, sat down, seated"},null]}]}